# (build 145) A Dezolian shopkeeper's portrait, the picture dezolian3
# (portrait 18), in Zosa's item store (Building_ItemStore): one of the
# twelve pictures no route drew after build 142 (see
# paseo_hospital_picture). The four Dezolian portraits are one drawing
# (dezolian_portrait.png through WinArt_DezolianPortrait) in four
# palettes, so each is its own picture to hold to its tiles. A new game on
# Zosa's street, in at the door; without the translator the keeper
# speaks Dezolian ($0810), and C lets the party out.

start level 11 19 17                # Zosa, two cells below the door
wait screen level
wait idle
walk up 3                           # one step, then the door takes the pad
wait screen building
wait idle
expect script $0810                 # "Danyaraha? bebekucha?"
expect picture 56 64 dezolian3
shot 01_dezolian3
press c
wait screen level
wait idle
expect level 11
expect picture 56 64 none
expect no-stderr not ported
